    <!--
        Deleting an account happens on the web, so this row opens the settings page that
        starts it rather than doing it here. Play requires the path to be reachable from
        inside the app; duplicating the flow natively would mean a second confirmation UI
        to keep in step with the first, for something done once in an account's life — and
        the confirmation that matters is a link in an email either way.
    -->
